{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c6d01c8a05967237a7dbfe827652c7f1.avif?t=1766893117\" width=964 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic 2D roguelite deckbuilding adventure where every decision shapes your destiny. Explore a procedurally generated world, master a tactical combat system based on positioning, and build a unique hero with a deck tailored to your strategy. Do you have what it takes to conquer the grand tournament?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/9a93fb178a6adaf2bee43c8315a2bf12.poster.avif?t=1766893117\" width=916 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/9a93fb178a6adaf2bee43c8315a2bf12.webm?t=1766893117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living, Ever-Changing World:</strong> Explore procedurally generated maps with  events, quests, and encounters that make every run a distinct adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Tactical Combat:</strong> Master a positional card-based system that rewards strategy, planning, and synergies to outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Customization:</strong> Craft your ideal hero with over 3,200 combinations of gear, upgrades, and abilities. Tailor your deck to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Synergies:</strong> Combine cards creatively to unleash devastating combos and tackle every challenge with cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path to the Grand Tournament:</strong> Face unique enemies, uncover secrets, and evolve your hero to prepare for the ultimate showdown that tests your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/252f504413594086e5c96abfea8eba52.avif?t=1766893117\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards with precision to maximize synergies, counter enemy strategies, and dominate the battlefield like a true tactical master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A DYNAMIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through unique biomes, discover mysterious villages, hidden treasures, and events that reshape your adventure with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your hero with gear upgrades and special abilities. Every piece matters to create an unstoppable warrior, ready for any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/d9c11e9288a0048beee4abf267ee993b.poster.avif?t=1766893117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/d9c11e9288a0048beee4abf267ee993b.webm?t=1766893117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/d9c11e9288a0048beee4abf267ee993b.mp4?t=1766893117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938290?t=1766893117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/f4224b3f6d4edbcc9e07c8c17bd7e14f109466e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766893117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766893117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766893117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3941190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c6d01c8a05967237a7dbfe827652c7f1.avif?t=1766893117\" width=964 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic 2D roguelite deckbuilding adventure where every decision shapes your destiny. Explore a procedurally generated world, master a tactical combat system based on positioning, and build a unique hero with a deck tailored to your strategy. Do you have what it takes to conquer the grand tournament?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/9a93fb178a6adaf2bee43c8315a2bf12.poster.avif?t=1766893117\" width=916 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/9a93fb178a6adaf2bee43c8315a2bf12.webm?t=1766893117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=